## Sequencing notes

- {{SEQUENCING_NOTE_1}}
- Milestone 1 always runs FULL — it establishes the coding/testing conventions that later
  LIGHT-mode work depends on (see `.ai-company/MODE_SELECTION.md`).
- Any milestone touching auth, payments, PII, persistent data-schema changes, external
  API/credential behavior, or destructive/irreversible operations runs FULL regardless of size.
